      <div id="p-0021" num="0020" class="description-paragraph"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. <b>2</b> </figref> is Stress Strain plot of PP and HDPE Membranes. <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. <b>3</b> </figref> is SEM Micrograph of the Surface of CE 6 Microporous Film at 20,000× Magnification.</div>
